    "text": "Suppose that a cyclic group A of order 4 is a T I-subgroup of a finite group G.\n   a) Does A centralize a component L of G if A intersects L · C(L) trivially?\n   b) What is the structure of the normal closure of A in the case where A centralizes\neach component of G?                                                   A. A. Makhnëv",
